{"id":"n91771-1-8","stage":3,"title":"주제 · 主题","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91771-1-8-1","ko":"오늘은 뭐에 대한 강의가 있는지 알아?","zh":"你知道今天要讲什么主题的课吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐에","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐에","audio":"/audio/5905378ca2fc84e36916.mp3"}},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대한","audio":"/audio/1d9b6fadeae799dde72f.mp3"}},{"text":"강의가","meaning":"讲课，授课，讲授","explanation":"강의：讲课，授课，讲授；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강의","audio":"/audio/53636f085f1a8b76ba97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15697","senseId":"1","lemma":"강의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강의가","audio":"/audio/0ad17b603a6c6b884b87.mp3"}},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는지","audio":"/audio/7df109195b78bcf9f45d.mp3"}},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],